  },
  {
    "question_number": "1(b)",
    "answer_text": "**SELECT COUNT(PID) FROM SCHOOL, PSTUD WHERE SCHOOL.SID = PSTUD.SID AND SNAME LIKE '%GOVERNMENT%'**\n**或 COUNT(*)**\n**其他答案: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM PSTUD WHERE SID IN (SELECT SID FROM SCHOOL WHERE SNAME LIKE '%GOVERNMENT%')**",
